  "flow_summary": "The interviewer successfully navigated a challenging, disorganized patient persona, demonstrating patience and persistence in clarifying vague responses. While the interviewer handled the safety disclosure appropriately, the intake was marred by excessive repetition of standardized questionnaire items when the patient struggled to understand the format, and some questions were asked multiple times due to the patient's confusion.",
